InternalHosts         /etc/opendkim/TrustedHosts

Socket                unix:/run/opendkim/opendkim.sock
PidFile               /run/opendkim/opendkim.pid
UMask                 007
UserID                opendkim
Syslog                yes
LogWhy                yes
